
  Approve setup in your browser

  Approve each request in the setup tab.
  The next request opens in the same tab.

  ⣽ Cloudflare: Allow
    On the Cloudflare page, select API Tokens: Write,
    and then select Allow. Cloudflare leaves
    API Tokens: Write unselected, and setup needs it
    to create your site's deploy key.
  ○ GitHub: Create
  ○ GitHub: Install & Authorize
  ○ GitHub: Approve

  If no tab opened, go to
  http://127.0.0.1:49152/?k=5f0c9e2a7b4d4e1f8a3c6b9d0e2f4a71

  To resume, run cairn new again.

  Ctrl+C stop